    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numero Auto</strong> is a minimalist automation puzzle game where you build logic-based machines to manipulate numbers using physics-driven flows and transformations. Solve increasingly complex challenges by designing elegant numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automate Numbers</strong> \u2014 Build logic-driven machines that transform and route numbers without your direct input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 <strong>Data Flow Mechanics</strong> \u2014 Guide numbers through channels, designing precise and efficient numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Increasingly Complex Puzzles</strong> \u2014 Each level presents a new logical challenge with multiple possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Modules and Nodes</strong> \u2014 Combine simple blocks (pushers, adders, and multipliers) to create intricate automation chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Physics-Based Interactions</strong> \u2014 Numbers are physical objects that roll, fall, collide, and get stuck \u2014 take momentum into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Endless Optimization</strong> \u2014 Revisit previous levels to improve your designs for speed, space efficiency, or elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive Interface</strong> \u2014 Drag-and-drop block building with clear visual connections makes the game easy to learn and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Open-Ended Solutions</strong> \u2014 There\u2019s no single right answer \u2014 creativity is your most powerful tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>For Logic Lovers</strong> \u2014 Perfect for players who enjoy watching everything click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Numero Auto</strong> is a minimalist automation puzzle game where you build logic-based machines to manipulate numbers using physics-driven flows and transformations. Solve increasingly complex challenges by designing elegant numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automate Numbers</strong> \u2014 Build logic-driven machines that transform and route numbers without your direct input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 <strong>Data Flow Mechanics</strong> \u2014 Guide numbers through channels, designing precise and efficient numeric systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Increasingly Complex Puzzles</strong> \u2014 Each level presents a new logical challenge with multiple possible solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Modules and Nodes</strong> \u2014 Combine simple blocks (pushers, adders, and multipliers) to create intricate automation chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Physics-Based Interactions</strong> \u2014 Numbers are physical objects that roll, fall, collide, and get stuck \u2014 take momentum into account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Endless Optimization</strong> \u2014 Revisit previous levels to improve your designs for speed, space efficiency, or elegance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Intuitive Interface</strong> \u2014 Drag-and-drop block building with clear visual connections makes the game easy to learn and satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Open-Ended Solutions</strong> \u2014 There\u2019s no single right answer \u2014 creativity is your most powerful tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>For Logic Lovers</strong> \u2014 Perfect for players who enjoy watching everything click into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
